  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "上kài好"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>黃靜惠</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我上愛看海</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh無愛蹛tī海邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我無愛peh山</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">但是我希望以後</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">骨頭hu ē-tàng掖tī</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">美麗ê山頭</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">奇怪？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">矛盾？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">其實一點仔to bē</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我只是做人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有一phí-phí仔</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">實際niā-niā</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">海邊風大</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">冷吱吱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寒--人冷kah ná冰枝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Peh山食力</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">忝uainn-uainn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熱天喘khuì ē pûn火</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不而過</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">吐出最後一口khuì了後</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就啥mi̍h lóng免驚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">靈魂來去自由</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">長眠ê所在</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上好是美麗ê山崙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">面向大海</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一兼二顧</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē-tàng摸lâ仔兼洗褲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Án-ne</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">好山好水好地理</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">就上kài好</span></p><span><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhERjH18ktdlIOFm29WSOcqZ4XyPUI3h2HrZ7bLcsUTa1KA4u7ANcQpwh6mLXJ5Hi1HOopxFSreVZntEBYY03dUknYjF-2jvSpp35QRJQ_btcDI_soWSX05s5cgjdoDstKl1x_8whKvz_LeDwh_CKbb2iqaBXOEd5QlKImFuCTdFsAE3aBLAgMo0DcLaw/s1421/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-widt